<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN WIN TOSS AND PUT SRI LANKA IN TO BAT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN WIN TOSS AND PUT SRI LANKA IN TO BAT.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan won the toss and asked Sri Lanka to bat in their Singer Champions' Trophy one-day match on Friday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka - Arjuna Ranatunga (captain), Sanath Jayasuriya, Romesh Kaluwitharana, Asanka Gurusinha, Aravinda de Silva, Hashan Tillekeratne, Roshan Mahanama, Kumara Dharmasena, Chaminda Vaas, Muttiah Muralitharan, Sanjeeva de Silva.</p>
<p>Pakistan - Wasim Akram (captain), Saeed Anwar, Shahid Afridi, Aamir Sohail, Ijaz Ahmed, Salim Malik, Azam Khan, Moin Khan, Saqlain Mushtaq, Waqar Younis, Shahid Nazir.</p>
</text>
